<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - Feb 7.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - Feb 7.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Cochin port on February 7:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons	    Ship		    Berthing</p>
<p>		     (LDD/ULD)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Crude		49,000 (ULD)     Jawaharlal Nehru     07/02</p>
<p>Raw Cashew	  1,700 (ULD)     Reef Ramba	     04/02</p>
<p>Cement		2,500 (ULD)     Oscar Syrious	  05/02</p>
<p>High Speed</p>
<p> Diesel	     5,000 (LDD)     Vishva Doot	    06/02</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Cochin)</p>
